Let's trace the LRU page replacement step-by-step with 3 frames:
1. Ref: 7 -> Fault. Frames: [7, _, _] (Faults: 1)
2. Ref: 0 -> Fault. Frames: [7, 0, _] (Faults: 2)
3. Ref: 1 -> Fault. Frames: [7, 0, 1] (Faults: 3)
4. Ref: 2 -> Fault. Evict 7 (least recently used). Frames: [2, 0, 1] (Faults: 4)
5. Ref: 0 -> Hit. Frames: [2, 0, 1]. Recency list: {0, 2, 1}
6. Ref: 3 -> Fault. Evict 1 (least recently used among {0, 2, 1}). Frames: [2, 0, 3] (Faults: 5). Recency list: {3, 0, 2}
7. Ref: 0 -> Hit. Frames: [2, 0, 3]. Recency list: {0, 3, 2}
8. Ref: 4 -> Fault. Evict 2 (least recently used among {0, 3, 2}). Frames: [4, 0, 3] (Faults: 6). Recency list: {4, 0, 3}
9. Ref: 2 -> Fault. Evict 3 (least recently used). Frames: [4, 0, 2] (Faults: 7). Recency list: {2, 4, 0}
10. Ref: 3 -> Fault. Evict 0 (least recently used). Frames: [4, 3, 2] (Faults: 8). Recency list: {3, 2, 4}
Total page faults = 8.

